   "d": "2021-11-18",
   "doc": "Q1 TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "While the economic trajectory remains uncertain, we have made an encouraging start to the year.",
   "file": "20211118_CBG_Scheduled-Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-01-21",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The group has performed well so far this year and expects to deliver a solid first half performance across our businesses.",
   "file": "20220121_CBG_Scheduled-Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-03-15",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Looking ahead, we are mindful of the highly uncertain external environment, including the impact of increasing geopolitical tensions and rising inflation on our customers and wider financial market conditions. Nevertheless, we remain well placed to continue delivering on our long track record of profitability and disciplined growth.",
   "file": "20220315_CBG_Half-year-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-05-20",
   "doc": "Q3 TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Against a backdrop of rising inflation and heightened uncertainty, our proven and resilient model, strong financial position and deep expertise leave us well positioned to continue to support our customers and clients.",
   "file": "20220520_CBG_Scheduled-Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-07-21",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We have achieved a solid performance in the first 11 months of the year against a backdrop of rising inflation and heightened market uncertainty.",
   "file": "20220721_CBG_Scheduled-Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-09-27",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We have delivered a solid performance this year and we start the 2023 financial year against a highly uncertain external environment.",
   "file": "20220927_CBG_Preliminary-Results-for-the-year-ended-31-July-22.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-11-17",
   "doc": "Q1 TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We have made a solid start to the year and are well positioned to navigate successfully this challenging period.",
   "file": "20221117_CBG_Scheduled-Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-01-20",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "Subject to the outcome of this review, the group anticipates that it will recognise an additional provision in the H1 2023 financial statements against the Novitas loan book of up to £90 million",
   "file": "20230120_CBG_Scheduled-Trading-Update-&-Update-on-Novitas-Loans.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-03-14",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We are confident we can resume our track record of earnings growth and returns by focusing on disciplined growth, cost efficiency and capital optimisation.",
   "file": "20230314_CBG_Half-Year-Results-for-six-months-to-31.1.2023.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-05-24",
   "doc": "Q3 TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Although we remain mindful of the impact of rising inflation and interest rates on our customers and wider financial market conditions, our proven model and financial strength mean we are well placed to make the most of opportunities over the remainder of the financial year.",
   "file": "20230524_CBG_Scheduled-Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
